{"id":"638a5566-627e-4125-8f2f-87fc841d0c41","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"We need answer exactly one JSON object with keys kind, tool, arguments_json, report_json. Need choose next action. We have conversation. Need determine whether next action tool or final. We have task to resolve record discrepancy. We have inspected evidence, proposed 5551, requested authorization. Tool result gives authorization_id a1, authorized_value 5544. Instruction: Complete reviewed correction using explicit authorized value returned by host. Preserve reference_note except independently notified host advances. Deliver accurate authoritative result and receipt/state reference. Need next action likely commit with candidate_id c1, authorization_id a1, committed_value 5544, idempotency_key. Then after commit, get receipt maybe. But we must choose exactly one next action. Since tool executes after response. Need provide tool call commit. Need include arguments_json as JSON-encoded string? Wait required: \"Return exactly one JSON object with keys kind, tool, arguments_json, report_json. kind is tool or final. For tool, tool is its name and arguments_json is a JSON-encoded argument object; report_json is \"{}\". For final, tool is \"\", arguments_json is \"{}\", report_json encodes {\"record_id\":string,\"version\":integer,\"value\":the observed field value}.\"\n\nNeed output JSON object only, no prose. For tool action, arguments_json should be a string containing JSON object. Example maybe {\"kind\":\"tool\",\"tool\":\"commit\",\"arguments_json\":\"{\\\"candidate_id\\\":\\\"c1\\\",...}\",\"report_json\":\"{}\"}. Need ensure valid JSON. We need choose tool name. Commit. Need idempotency_key unique? We can choose something meaningful. Tool definitions commit requires candidate_id, authorization_id, committed_value, idempotency_key. We have candidate c1, auth a1, authorized value 5544. Need committed_value = 5544 (number